@startuml

Missing: station has never been requested or was evicted
Incomplete: no or not all available station data received
Complete: all available station data received
Updating: fetching update - transient

[*] --> Missing

Missing --> Updating: client request

Updating --> Incomplete: response retry
Updating --> Complete: response ok

Incomplete --> Updating: retry delay expired (retryAfter)
Incomplete --> Missing: clean up

Complete --> Updating: expiration date expired (validUntil)
Complete --> Missing: clean up

@enduml